OL,3,CJames McClean arrives to club training
OL,4,Camid termination speculation
OL,6,FJames McClean arrived for training at
OL,7,FDerry City on Tuesday morning amidst
OL,8,Fspeculation that the Club are prepared
OL,9,Fto terminate his contract.
OL,11,FOn Monday, reports that the
OL,12,Ffootballer's time at his hometown club
OL,13,Fwas expected to come to an end after
OL,14,Fjust seven months.
OL,16,FThe 37-year-old returned to the League
OL,17,Fof Ireland Premier Division in January
OL,18,Fon a multi-year contract.
OL,20,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,21,FITVX
